---
title:    "Eliminating Irrelevant Non-determinism in Functional Logic Programs"
citation: "(PADL 2017)"
url:      "http://dx.doi.org/10.1007/978-3-319-51676-9_1"
date:     2017-01-01 # used for sorting, most recent first, should usually match the papers date
---
This paper proposes determinism annoations for operations defined in Curry.
A determinism annotation avoids the recomputation of identical results and,
thus, improve the operational behavior of Curry programs without
destroying its completeness.
Determinism annotations are integrated with a preprocessor
in the Curry implementations [PAKCS](http://www.informatik.uni-kiel.de/~pakcs/ "Portland Aachen Kiel Curry System") and
[KiCS2](http://www-ps.informatik.uni-kiel.de/kics2 "Kiel Curry System").